Icon masters and where they came from:

  app-master.svg   the "whatsapp" icon from the WhiteSur-apps icon theme
                   (https://github.com/vinceliuice/WhiteSur-icon-theme, GPL-3.0)
  tray-master.png  the WhatsApp mark the maintainer was already using locally

Everything under the numbered size directories is generated from these two by
tools/make-icons.py -- run `make icons`, never hand-edit the output.
